Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 19:14:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Route gfx1201 INT8 GEMM by shape

- Route seven measured small-M W8A8 shape
  ranges to Triton when it beats CKTile.
- Keep CKTile for unlisted and larger shapes.
- Account for N- and K-dependent crossovers;
  one M threshold regresses some models.
- Cover selector and device routing boundaries.
- Validate 32 tests and runtime comparisons on
  an RX 9070 XT.

Tools used:
- GPT-5.6 Sol: GPT-5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
